//   TEXT(H,E,L,L,O)  ->  &kp H &kp E &kp L &kp L &kp O
// Keycodes are written as-is (C, RET, SPACE, COMMA, DOT, SQT, MINUS).
// Arity is capped at 33; raise NARG/NARG_ and add KP34+ to go higher.
